{
  "_comment": "Edit this file to add, remove or swap data sources. A news feed is RSS, Atom or a Google News sitemap; give it as a URL, or as {url, type, url_contains, format}. type is news, analysis, official or humanitarian and sets the tag colour. format 'reliefweb-api' reads ReliefWeb situation reports (set appname, or the RELIEFWEB_APPNAME environment variable); format 'ofac-html' reads the US Treasury OFAC Recent Actions page. Set enabled:false to switch a source off without deleting it.",
